## R8. VERDICT

The mathematics of the discharge holds. THEOREM WZ-A is correct, its lift and
domain hypotheses are met by pinned suppliers, WZ-1 and WZ-2 are correctly
transposed and T1 really is uniform in the base height, the W-9 clause table is
complete against GENHN's own division-of-consumption declaration, the
non-circularity audit survives an independent re-check, WZ-A′'s falsification of
SG-2's X(ii) is real, and the battery reproduces at 9,877/0. WZ-PIN is not just
defensible — the corpus's pinned readers implement it in source.

What blocks a clean pass is one false displayed clause and one false empirical
claim, both about the *same* object (the ϑ-dictionary D_κ) and both pointing the
same way: D_κ separates types pointwise while preserving counts, which is a mode
J-D0 does not describe and which the corpus has already, unknowingly, machine-
tested 972 times in a sealed row. Neither repair weakens the discharge; both
require the note to say something different from what it says.

FINDINGS: 1C + 1G + 8m
